Golden Rule
Plain Text1Retrieve only what the user is authorized to see.Show more lines
Microsoft’s secure multitenant RAG guidance states that in multitenant scenarios, tenants and users must only incorporate grounding data they are authorized to access. [learn.microsoft.com]
